.SS " str sphinx\&.config\&._substitute_copyright_year (str copyright_line, str current_year, str
 replace_year)\fC [protected]\fP"

.PP
.nf
Replace the year in a single copyright line\&.

Legal formats are:

* ``YYYY``
* ``YYYY,``
* ``YYYY ``
* ``YYYY-YYYY``
* ``YYYY-YYYY,``
* ``YYYY-YYYY ``

The final year in the string is replaced with ``replace_year``\&.

.fi
.PP
 
